WEBVTT

00:57:58.807 --> 00:58:01.887
I do think a pool of money
needs to be created

00:58:01.911 --> 00:58:05.791
to help assist the displaced
workers in moving on.

00:58:05.815 --> 00:58:08.577
But it's not to give
the same amount to everyone,

00:58:08.601 --> 00:58:13.363
but to give more to those
who are engaged in retraining

00:58:13.387 --> 00:58:15.410
and become gainfully employed,

00:58:15.434 --> 00:58:19.272
and also those who are going
into the professions

00:58:19.296 --> 00:58:21.673
that are not going to be displaced by AI,

00:58:21.697 --> 00:58:23.681
such as the elderly care

00:58:23.705 --> 00:58:26.529
or other types
of compassionate professions.

00:58:27.196 --> 00:58:31.466
CA: Your book and your talk
have framed AI as this --